graph TD
    Start([Authentication Request]) --> CheckStorage{Token File<br/>Exists?}
    
    CheckStorage -->|No| UseOAuth[Use OAuth Authentication]
    CheckStorage -->|Yes| ReadToken[Read Token from Storage]
    
    ReadToken --> ParseToken{Token Data<br/>Valid?}
    ParseToken -->|No| CleanupToken[Remove Invalid Token]
    CleanupToken --> UseOAuth
    
    ParseToken -->|Yes| CheckExpiry{Token<br/>Expired?}
    CheckExpiry -->|Yes| TryRefresh[Try Token Refresh]
    CheckExpiry -->|No| UseToken[Use Token Authentication]
    
    TryRefresh --> RefreshSuccess{Refresh<br/>Successful?}
    RefreshSuccess -->|Yes| UseToken
    RefreshSuccess -->|No| UseOAuth
    
    UseToken --> TokenResult{Token Auth<br/>Result?}
    TokenResult -->|Success| AuthComplete([Authentication Complete])
    TokenResult -->|HTTP Error| AnalyzeTokenError[Analyze Token Error]
    TokenResult -->|JSON Error| AnalyzeTokenError
    
    AnalyzeTokenError --> TokenCorrupted{Token<br/>Corrupted?}
    TokenCorrupted -->|Yes| RemoveToken[Remove Token File]
    TokenCorrupted -->|No| ProxyTokenError[Handle Proxy Error]
    
    RemoveToken --> UseOAuth
    ProxyTokenError --> AuthComplete
    
    UseOAuth --> OAuthResult{OAuth<br/>Result?}
    OAuthResult -->|Success| AuthComplete
    OAuthResult -->|Failed| AuthFailed([Authentication Failed])
    
    style UseToken fill:#e8f5e8
    style UseOAuth fill:#e3f2fd
    style AuthComplete fill:#c8e6c9
    style AuthFailed fill:#ffcdd2